WEBVTT

00:04:55.299 --> 00:05:00.018
In zdaj smo tam.

00:05:00.018 --> 00:05:02.646
Ko gledamo ven, 
nekakšen surrealen trenutek,

00:05:02.646 --> 00:05:04.157
pred prvim zamahom,

00:05:04.157 --> 00:05:06.683
stojim na skalah Marine Hemingway,

00:05:06.683 --> 00:05:09.376
nad nami plapola zastava Kube,

00:05:09.376 --> 00:05:11.968
vsa moja ekipa v svojih čolnih,

00:05:11.968 --> 00:05:18.650
z rokami v zraku:
"Tu smo zate, tu smo zate,"

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:20.655
Bonnie in jaz se spogledava in rečeva,

00:05:20.655 --> 00:05:22.610
letošnja mantra je -

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:25.016
in uporabljali smo jo pri treningu -

00:05:25.016 --> 00:05:27.064
najdi pot.

00:05:27.064 --> 00:05:29.671
Imaš sanje

00:05:29.671 --> 00:05:32.686
in imaš ovire pred seboj, tako kot vsi.